lso, is what"},{"sec":6.6,"text":">> [music]"},{"sec":6.6,"text":">> they call as like mythology and all of"},{"sec":8.8,"text":"that, right? Like they could not process"},{"sec":10.9,"text":"this multitude of stories that people"},{"sec":12.8,"text":"used to narrate about their past, about"},{"sec":14.6,"text":"their gods, and about creation, about a"},{"sec":17.3,"text":"lot of these life events and all of"},{"sec":19.2,"text":"that, right? So, I think there is also"},{"sec":21.3,"text":"that that happened where things sort of"},{"sec":23.5,"text":"got compartmentalized saying that this"},{"sec":25.7,"text":"is like history, this is verifiable"},{"sec":28.2,"text":"history, this is mythology, uh this is"},{"sec":30.7,"text":"like fiction. These are things that you"},{"sec":32.6,"text":"people used to tell to yourself just to"},{"sec":34.2,"text":"comfort, these didn't actually happen."},{"sec":36.4,"text":"Or uh you know, like these are just just"},{"sec":39.2,"text":"like stories, like fairy tales. So, the"},{"sec":41.2,"text":"all of these constructs have a lot of"},{"sec":42.8,"text":"baggage, like this thing this idea of a"},{"sec":44.8,"text":"fairy tale, this idea of mythology, this"},{"sec":46.8,"text":"idea of history, all of these, right?"},{"sec":48.7,"text":"They had a lot of baggage. So, you'll"},{"sec":50.2,"text":"find a lot of those sort of discourses"},{"sec":52.1,"text":"as well, which is trying to explain that"},{"sec":54.4,"text":"what is history, what is itihasa, what"},{"sec":56.5,"text":"is purana."},{"sec":59,"text":">> [music]"}],"text":""}}